{"ID":"20240205153828-b0w6vrw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153828-b0w6vrw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153828-b0w6vrw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163856-440ue4p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240221194010-zcktu0m\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163856-440ue4p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"瓜蒌实（栝蒌实、栝楼实）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902105558"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205163856-440ue4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163856-440ue4p"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒌"}]},{"ID":"20240206095612-agwqdwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095612-agwqdwu","updated":"20240206095615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于河南、河北、山东、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t果实呈卵状扁平椭圆形，长1116mm，宽612mm，厚2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.5mm。表面浅棕色至棕褐色，平滑，边缘有一圈沟纹，顶端尖有种脐，基部钝圆或较狭。种皮坚硬，剖开后可见内种皮膜质，色灰白至灰绿色，含两片黄白色子叶，富油性。瓜蒌子内种皮白色，外种皮棕褐色，子夜2。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，寒。\n【功效】\t润肺，化痰，散结，润肠。治痰热咳嗽，胸痹，结胸，肺痿咳血，消渴，黄疸，便秘，痈肿初起。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095607-o4vl731","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095607-o4vl731","updated":"20240717112223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095607-bm8esyc.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163906-bol7gi4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163906-bol7gi4","updated":"20240717112302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 407px;","style":"width: 397px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌-20240205163906-n1dxsf0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 397px;\" parent-style=\"width: 407px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 468px;","style":"width: 458px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624124736-cqjcs5i.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 458px;\" parent-style=\"width: 468px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717195722-qnjfytn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717195722-qnjfytn","updated":"20240717195852"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 486px;","style":"width: 476px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栝楼 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栝楼 3-20240717195722-ucjieia.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 476px;\" parent-style=\"width: 486px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 486px;","style":"width: 476px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌 7-20240717195958-e4le88l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 476px;\" parent-style=\"width: 486px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114411-0an6fno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114411-0an6fno","updated":"20240717114411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 398px;","style":"width: 388px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624123154-4n2yi7m.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 388px;\" parent-style=\"width: 398px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 340px;","style":"width: 330px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栝楼"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栝楼-20240624123611-854rjc9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 330px;\" parent-style=\"width: 340px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 401px;","style":"width: 391px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240624123712-ecvmhlk.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 391px;\" parent-style=\"width: 401px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114411-3aymntr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114411-3aymntr","updated":"20240717114411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 344px;","style":"width: 334px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"栝楼根5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/栝楼根5-20240624124157-wjg5esr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 334px;\" parent-style=\"width: 344px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 899px;","style":"width: 889px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌6-20240624124248-4wednuz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 889px;\" parent-style=\"width: 899px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717114411-6737xrt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717114411-6737xrt","updated":"20240717114411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 673px;","style":"width: 663px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌-20240717112518-35sfhq5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 663px;\" parent-style=\"width: 673px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 586px;","style":"width: 576px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瓜蒌 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瓜蒌 1-20240717112749-55cfxl1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 576px;\" parent-style=\"width: 586px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240